{"title": "Cursed Vengeance", "pageid": 31524, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Cursed_Vengeance", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Cursed Vengeance</b> is a passive affecting <a href=\"/wiki/Oliver\" title=\"Oliver\">Oliver</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Nightdome\" title=\"Nightdome\">Nightdome</a> that protects Oliver and redirects damage back to its source.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Oliver's Nightdome won't allow for you to hurt him. Any damage done to the dome will be reflected in twofold to its attacker. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Cursed_Vengeance\"> Condition: Cursed Vengeance </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Vengeance_(Condition)\" title=\"Cursed Vengeance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cursed Vengeance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Vengeance_(Condition)\" title=\"Cursed Vengeance (Condition)\">Cursed Vengeance</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Any damage done against Oliver will be reflected twofold at the attacker.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i>\n</p>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714162757\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 791/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5073/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1572/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643716/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.015      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   31.015      1 -total\n 45.64%   14.156      1 Template:Condition\n 32.96%   10.223      1 Template:Condition_full/format\n 31.05%    9.629      1 Template:Icon_link\n 30.04%    9.317      1 Template:Icon_text\n 26.14%    8.108      3 Template:Trim\n 22.33%    6.927      1 Template:Ifempty\n 13.15%    4.077      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 11.44%    3.549      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31524-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714162757 and revision id 244097. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}